			</span></i>,al. (Mytil.), Thess. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεινν-</span></b>  ib.<i><span class="en">
				9(2).258.5
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cierium</span>); dat. pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μησί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.43
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				8.51
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήνεσἱν</span>
